  "schema:name": "Soil Organic Carbon Content",
  "schema:description": "High-resolution (10 m) map of cropland soil organic carbon (SOC) **content** (0-30 cm, g/kg) for Germany. Predictions were produced with support vector machines from a 10 m Sentinel-2 bare-soil composite and trained on topsoil samples of the German Agricultural Soil Inventory (BZE-LW) [(Broeg et al., 2026)](https://doi.org/10.1016/j.rse.2025.115109). An accompanying uncertainty map (95 % prediction interval, +-1.96 sigma) is provided as a separate *uncertainty* asset. The spatial extent covers agricultural land defined by ATKIS Basis-DLM (© GeoBasis-DE / BKG, 2025).",
  "schema:keywords": [
    "soil",
    "soil organic carbon",
    "SOC",
    "carbon content",
